    <Description>Bot to farm automatically with alt:

1. Go to the harvesting point and start the macro.

2. The character will start doing its job, but don't forget to press alt at the same time to avoid bugs 

3. It will run as many times as you choose.

The script clicks left, moves the mouse to the right and clicks left to start processing, then waits, and starts again after a certain amount of time (which can be modified according to the duration).

Use 1920x1080 resolution</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
